I was confused by Krzysztof's Jacobian which can be simplied a lot.

J[1, 1] = x / sqrt(x^2+y^2);

J[1, 2] = y / sqrt(x^2+y^2);

J[2, 1] = - y / (x^2 + y^2);

J[2, 2,] = x / (x^2 + y^2);

You can see these are symmetric in the x and y are appear in different terms.

regards,
